she wasn't going to acknowledge it there.

00:08:01.747 --> 00:08:02.748
And look,

00:08:02.748 --> 00:08:04.417
she's giving voters

00:08:04.417 --> 00:08:05.918
a bit of an excuse to say, look,

00:08:05.918 --> 00:08:07.954
I'm a brown person from the South

00:08:07.954 --> 00:08:09.322
and I'm saying it's okay.

